\section{Package boundaries}{

Build graphs with \code{dgraphs} and pass adjacency and weight lists to \code{gflow}.
Use \code{gflowx} only when reproducing archived graph-regression or smoothing
analyses. PHATE, diffusion/potential pseudotime, generic graph utilities,
interactive selection widgets, and domain-specific pipelines are not part
of the supported \code{gflow} surface.
